#. ~ Description of "faraday chainmail suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A fully customized chainmail suit that can be worn over your normal clothing."
"  The suit is conductively interconnected with a cage covering the face, "
"protecting against electricity."
msgstr ""

